{"id":"d05bde9d5231d251","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-laver.md","title":"Laver Forcing Adds a Dominating Real","display":"thm-laver — Laver Forcing Adds a Dominating Real","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-laver","aliases":["58-thm-laver"],"display":"thm-laver — Laver Forcing Adds a Dominating Real","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-laver.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-laver"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-laver</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-laver — Laver Forcing Adds a Dominating Real"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f296fc34ba0d5288\" href=\"?note=f296fc34ba0d5288\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-laver.md\">../batch06/58-df-laver.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md\">../batch15/58-df-forcing.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"393515cdafde1b06\" href=\"?note=393515cdafde1b06\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,G,f,g,\\ell\\in V\">\\(M,G,f,g,\\ell\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb L\">\\(\\mathbb L\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb L}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb L}\\)</span> 是 Laver forcing 及其次序（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f296fc34ba0d5288\" href=\"?note=f296fc34ba0d5288\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-laver.md\">../batch06/58-df-laver.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingSetup}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingSetup}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（可数传递模型上的强迫配置谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md\">../batch15/58-df-forcing.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> 是 ZFC 公理集（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"393515cdafde1b06\" href=\"?note=393515cdafde1b06\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{\\mathbb L}\">\\(R_{\\mathbb L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EventuallyDominates}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{EventuallyDominates}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LaverReal}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{LaverReal}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 在本原子中定义</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laver\\text{-}order\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\nR_{\\mathbb L}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle S,T\\rangle\\in\\mathbb L^2:S\\leq_{\\mathbb L}T\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laver\\text{-}order\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\nR_{\\mathbb L}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle S,T\\rangle\\in\\mathbb L^2:S\\leq_{\\mathbb L}T\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}domination}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EventuallyDominates}_S(g,f)\n\\leftrightarrow\nf,g\\in\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(n_0\\leq n\\to f(n)\\leq g(n)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}domination}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EventuallyDominates}_S(g,f)\n\\leftrightarrow\nf,g\\in\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(n_0\\leq n\\to f(n)\\leq g(n)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}laver\\text{-}real}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaverReal}_S(\\ell,G)\n\\leftrightarrow\nG\\subseteq\\mathbb L\n\\land\n\\ell=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{stem}(T):T\\in G\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}laver\\text{-}real}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaverReal}_S(\\ell,G)\n\\leftrightarrow\nG\\subseteq\\mathbb L\n\\land\n\\ell=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{stem}(T):T\\in G\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}laver\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\forall M,G\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathbb L,R_{\\mathbb L},G)\n\\to\n\\exists!\\ell\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{LaverReal}_S(\\ell,G)\n\\land\n\\forall f\\in M\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{EventuallyDominates}_S(\\ell,f)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}laver\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\forall M,G\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathbb L,R_{\\mathbb L},G)\n\\to\n\\exists!\\ell\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{LaverReal}_S(\\ell,G)\n\\land\n\\forall f\\in M\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{EventuallyDominates}_S(\\ell,f)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The generic real is obtained from the compatible stems in the generic filter.</li>\n<li>“支配所有基模型实数”现在由外部集合量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in M\\cap\\omega^\\omega\">\\(f\\in M\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> 表达，避免把真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\omega^\\omega)^V\">\\((\\omega^\\omega)^V\\)</span> 塞进对象语言中的检名。</li>\n<li>Laver forcing is proper and adds a dominating real; it is not <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-closed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-laver.md","status":"resolved","id":"f296fc34ba0d5288","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-laver.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"393515cdafde1b06","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-laver.md","status":"resolved","id":"f296fc34ba0d5288","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb L$ 与 $\\leq_{\\mathbb L}$ 是 Laver forcing 及其次序（见 [[../batch06/58-df-laver.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ForcingSetup}_S\\subseteq V^5$（可数传递模型上的强迫配置谓词，见 [[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"393515cdafde1b06","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZFC}$ 是 ZFC 公理集（见 [[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,G,f,g,\\ell\\in V","display":fal